Z||000009||Alex4mula||05-02-2001||08:53 AM||||If I turn off mines without pushing the bottom part of the swith they will stay up and off. But sometimes when I slam the door it makes contact and shut off. I do use it often on short stops at night to avoid wear.||||reg||1
Z||000010||ThatRickGuy||05-02-2001||09:54 AM||||Mine does it, there's 2 seperate switches for your lights. the uper left corner is grey, the rest is black. by pushing on the grey, the black will switch too, buy pushing the lower black, everything will turn off. If you only push the black in the upper right corner, only your running lights come one, headlights stay down. <P>But, if you have your lights on (and up) then pull out on the grey part (kind have to catch your finger on the top of it) the lights will stay up but they will turn off.||||reg||1
